    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:48ad4dcf1889121b8c5b1fc2184a900ec272dee614eb742b32bf79fd5356b97d",
      "request_id": "48ad4dcf1889121b8c5b1fc2184a900ec272dee614eb742b32bf79fd5356b97d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "098e1a89aa7c888b72303c97bddce170",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从对萨巴伦卡首盘一比四，到决赛首盘五比五。这周，你最记得她哪一次回应？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3dd67ce16c4d4b8389760552b77d6f4e67e0cf909b7aa842016c59829fcbbc7e",
      "words_sha256": "e5d502abfb3e29ebcdd56a5617afd776a2a27704cdf8754ba2ba721f418a71be"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9b593ad74d727bdc444c32ec55477117f174202fb758d09a0f55f7ff8c35640c",
      "request_id": "9b593ad74d727bdc444c32ec55477117f174202fb758d09a0f55f7ff8c35640c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d8402863fb91ea7cb57919029029f377",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第三场，她面对替补出战的施耐德，六比二、六比一。三场全胜，她把一盘未丢的势头带进淘汰赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "61e46f245ae67c43bec36d21268e021bc35595f34a4c3b7236e68b9b0ee06fa8",
      "words_sha256": "cf0427837a5cf3040a4809cf05e2604d30efc02dbf0118b5868ffd960d28b6ea"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ab6f0cf2d78ef1ba170c27dfe1815e145356e7d4b08bd90b65ed023ef4c16f08",
      "request_id": "ab6f0cf2d78ef1ba170c27dfe1815e145356e7d4b08bd90b65ed023ef4c16f08",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d8bde7aa4a0785e04da2d52e3e831464",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛又遇斯维托丽娜。首盘五比四发球，没能收下，被追成五比五。安德烈耶娃接着连拿两局；第二个盘点，底线相持中对手回球出界，她以七比五先下一盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "15e0ac0baaf343199c307eb717838f46f1b8dae8b5c97f95851ba9f22964cb4d",
      "words_sha256": "b059b47a7eae28002828ac0c4adaa4f6bd1e06d22ae9e2dc03b3a9a1a843d366"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:adabf59413b287471f12e4606e73e714343785f95c7264f495ba75c55d5f02bd",
      "request_id": "adabf59413b287471f12e4606e73e714343785f95c7264f495ba75c55d5f02bd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "335c0183503dd782b4bed783c6f70c8e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "对手的高压球下网。安德烈耶娃抛起球拍，跳了起来，随后走向教练席和团队拥抱。这个冠军，终于来到她手里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "59f4183b16b5bcd92e74493897f1d0cf1c5ea5191afbfd97eb9a78b665f55054",
      "words_sha256": "3b7ecdb97256d070c17e836e2e202dff1e481a8ad1fda815dee3b5de62abc2a1"
    },
